<p>10/01/1999		   55M    4.20  %	  4.20</p>
<p>10/01/2000		   55M    4.30  %	  4.35</p>
<p>10/01/2001		   60M    4.50  %	  4.50</p>
<p>10/01/2002		   65M    4.60  %	  4.65</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
