<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2009	     23,935M    6.00  %	  5.30</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, October 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.</p>
<p>DTC is pending.</p>
